  "N1" [label="(1,1,0) Currently human autoimmune diseases are characterized by disease-specific autoantibodies."];
  "N10" [label="(0,0,0) If it has proven challenging to study specific B cell responses underlying ANCA production in human AAV, then the objective is to characterize autoreactive, MPO-directed B cell responses in MPO + AAV patients."];
